# Demo video recorder output
scripts/demo-video/out/

# Scratch/local-only material: review decks, presentation exports, ad-hoc
# screenshots and video-recording scripts. Files already tracked here before
# this rule (db-reset.sh, demo.sh, the er-diagram generator, the syllabus PDF,
# etc.) are unaffected - .gitignore only stops NEW untracked files in these
# folders from being picked up by `git add`. Screenshots meant to be pushed
# live in docs/screenshots/ instead.
/reference/
/scripts/
